51f520b08f5d","title":"非份之罪国语","type":"dianshi","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260629-1/b890ab0b7019c86e4db4c711ed8f5f29.webp","lang":"粤语","area":"中国香港","year":"2026","note":"更新至第10集","actor":"吴启华 / 朱敏瀚 / 赖慰玲 / 陈炜 / 吴伟豪 / 单立文 / 阮浩棕 / 刘佩玥 / 徐荣 / 何沛珈 / 贝安琪 / 戴祖仪 / 游嘉欣 / 江嘉敏 / 韦家雄 / 郑子诚 / 卢宛茵 / 李家鼎 / 谭凯琪 / 邓智坚 / 江欣燕 / 黎燕珊 / 罗冠兰 / 苏韵姿 / 吴沚默 / 叶靖仪 / 唐嘉麟 / 张翼东 / 胡敏芝 / 区霭玲 / 方绍聪 / 梁证嘉 / 陈嘉俊 / 关枫馨 / 彭翔翎 / 梁皓楷 / 李启杰 / 鬼塚 / 蔡志恩 / 罗皓谊 / 陈俊坚 / 吴天佑 / 施焯日 /","director":"王心慰","des":"<p>人類的欲望，可驅使我們超越自我，然而，當欲望失控，過份貪圖金錢與權勢、追求不屬於自己的愛，非份之想被無限放大，一不經意，便陷入道德矛盾的深淵，犯下種種「非份之罪」……新界東重案組接連調查幾宗案件，包括「無臉女屍」、「石棺禁戀」、「一億殺機」、「危險遊戲」、「骯髒的子彈」、「恐怖情人」，錯綜複雜的線索、纏繞不清的關係，構成一樁樁匪夷所思的迷案，揭露觸摸不透的人性黑暗面。</p>","last":"2026-07-10 20:38:36","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260629/NfDGbaGF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260630/bFyJIz91/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260701/BQrHm7GH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260702/fPYiqRYo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260703/Vs2AOFeN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260706/tXAV2wSf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260707/a7QEEmC0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260708/gFXn8cEa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260709/mXpaaEod/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260710/zUHxKkjz/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/ce2b9a26bddc32cba5af69372ee14c00"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/3fe230348e9a12c13120749e3f9fa4cd"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/3db54f5573cd617a0112d35dd1e6b