","des":"<p>　人類的欲望，可驅使我們超越自我，然而，當欲望失控，過份貪圖金錢與權勢、追求不屬於自己的愛，非份之想被無限放大，一不經意，便陷入道德矛盾的深淵，犯下種種「非份之罪」……新界東重案組接連調查幾宗案件，包括「無臉女屍」、「石棺禁戀」、「一億殺機」、「危險遊戲」、「骯髒的子彈」、「恐怖情人」，錯綜複雜的線索、纏繞不清的關係，構成一樁樁匪夷所思的迷案，揭露觸摸不透的人性黑暗面。</p>","last":"2026-07-10 20:38:17","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260629/ZOji0Kcp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260630/GB3Dm82S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260701/HPvRSEaN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260702/fnr6FIhU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260703/jE0syUiK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260706/7f7lxU3i/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260707/Jgv6pAF2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260708/rYp2ah4v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260709/73kxcdAt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260710/fl80dF0z/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/51f4efbfb3e18f4ea053c4d3d282c4e2"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/3941c4358616274ac2436eacf67fae05"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/b0bf8b3daf61246d13276dc8dcdfb87d"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/47e03d48d5f53f03563daa7f1373fb09"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/697067b35029ffbb781fb6835e83a098"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/e57edfc7529f0c7b21788231308caeab"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/240497d1c93f3ea543976e5f331f3f9d"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/e44a045fd42b7e450f0554f33df0b073"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.lzcdn27.com/share/1