escending into betrayal and power plays as hidden agendas surface.</p>","last":"2026-06-17 21:57:24","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260617/DQMJcDUq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260617/ffkVnzig/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260617/1Swll28s/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260617/9QfiX7Sc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260617/6RuIMeM9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260617/x9uDS1Mw/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/share/d064bf1ad039ff366564f352226e7640"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/share/580f9aa264f1108da3db844806f3952e"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/share/5c333c4ffd55c7a3576e6a614d81af82"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/share/64de166633d61c8326232568b42beef1"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/share/21be992eb8016e541a15953eee90760e"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.lzcdn31.com/share/5735c3a7aa6ffcfe6ab123835584db75"}]},{"sourceName":"动漫发布 (hnm3u8)","sourceUrl":"http://ddmf.net/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"hnm3u8","links":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://hn.bfvvs.com/play/erk2lmEa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://hn.bfvvs.com/play/e0R8r9Xb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://hn.bfvvs.com/play/en5R9zld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://hn.bfvvs.com/play/dwp0qkwe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://hn.bfvvs.com/play/bDkqV0na/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集完结","url":"https://hn.bfvvs.com/play/b823Dooe/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"3640e648bbaf9576214d56932ff1317e","title":"香港探秘地图粤语","type":"dianshi","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260518-1/737de3472f6c58cfa3f9ae4db6be99b4.webp","lang":"粤语","area":"中国香港","year":"2026","note":"更新第20集","actor":"黎耀祥 / 龚嘉欣 / 丁子朗 / 孔德贤 / 倪嘉雯 /","director":"王伟仁","des":"<p>　「傳說探秘，引爆恐懼。」玄學大師莊一臣（黎耀祥飾）創立探秘頻道，以香港各處神秘地點作招徠宣揚迷信，探秘話題包括戰時無頭鬼、鵝頸橋神婆、尋找替身的民初女鬼、媚惑男性的狐仙顯靈、鬧鬼片場、屋邨UFO、米婆婆陰間招魂，及可困住三魂七魄的結界…獵奇探秘令莊一臣逐漸走紅；卻遭到剛強正直的打假網紅畢萍（龔嘉欣飾）狙擊，以科學解釋一一破解莊一臣的把戲與技倆！二人鬥氣鬥智鬥力，過程中畢萍慢慢撕開莊一臣隱藏的另一面，原來莊一臣是想借畢萍之手自揭黑歷史，藉此贖罪…</p>","last":"2026-06-12 20:50:42","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260518/goZC9Ufn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260520/Bab2TjQQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260520/SD6yByDL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260521/kKZHs8zi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260522/1dglKz6C/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260525/nvLijw5l/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260526/lf6lEkHE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260527/LeQ5uVsD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260528/uT0HeQos/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260529/hFYa7kg2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260601/RVjmHkwO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260602/dorO59Ww/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260603/8lpP6GR6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260604/AiKHPRWo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260605/4cyY7QQV/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260608/wSsad3bF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260609/nYvItz5p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260610/EfuJNfML/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第19集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/2026061