{"id":"d8eb264b85720058584223257c4c2b0a","title":"IT狗2.0","type":"dianshi","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260518-1/d60dea124ff057aa8303e21e1f4b1e69.webp","lang":"粤语","area":"中国香港","year":"2026","note":"全15集","actor":": 凌文龙 / 杨乐文 / 陈汉娜 / 岑珈其 / 余逸思 /","director":": 简君晋","des":"<p>作为一部被描述为“负能量的热血残酷励志丧笑喜剧”的作品，延续了前作对科技行业职场生态的黑色幽默刻画，聚焦当代青年在理想与现实间的挣扎。主要演员阵容包括凌文龙、杨乐文、陈汉娜、岑珈其、余逸思、陈湛文、陈瑞辉及邱士缙，编剧团队由李卓风、唐翠萍、胡天朗、谭善扬和李嘉盈共同组成。</p>","last":"2026-05-18 11:22:50","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/pR85Gy0v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/lD9HUHAA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/Vgg28rB9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/fdHvdDoh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/PpwyB42D/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/yEeURQxo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/pDPOPupI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/aMljq8ul/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/VdgBxaj9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/lmKCmN4r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/CLbW6xMG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/ke5VOtl7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/7iLz33WR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/GjHJK78T/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260517/vf3YQMqS/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.lfthirtytwo.com/share/37f65c068b7723cd7809ee2d31d7861c"},{"name":"第02集","url":"h