5:["$","$L9",null,{"title":"热播综艺","keyName":"zongyi","videos":[{"id":"5bbd4f723e491fb3c1a368c122cdc991","title":"天籁与少年","type":"zongyi","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260705-1/6b9dd79c8e89879d2564ce0d06f4e1e0.jpg","lang":"汉语普通话","area":"中国大陆","year":"2026","note":"更新至20260712期纯享版","actor":"常思思 / 杨丽萍 / 张天启 / 胡海泉 / 艾热 / 阿朵","director":"","des":"<p>　河南卫视继“中国节日奇妙游系列”IP屡屡出圈后， 联合中国移动咪咕音乐和上海音享家科技有限公司着力打造首档全新民族文化类青春潮流音乐综艺《天籁与少年》！节目以“民族音乐 青春表达”为核心理念，依托河南卫视深厚的内容创作力与咪咕音乐的亿级传播平台，致力于打造一档既有文化厚度又具时代声量的标杆性节目。多位国家级音乐总监构成“音乐制作人天团”，以创作一首新时代有凝聚力、影响力、传播力的民族主题歌曲为使命，发出最燃民族少年征集令！我们将一起见证中华民族的少年们在音乐创作中践行“铸牢”使命，最终共同发出中华民族的潮流强音！</p>","last":"2026-07-12 19:51:24","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第20260704期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260705/T6sLgDW6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260705期纯享版","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260707/dzmEEQIA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260711期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260712/AAIHyi0v/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260712期纯享版","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260712/VoWgLK5x/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"20260704","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/91866be0ed30d6a36df817992d2a2ef3"},{"name":"20260711","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/a65f0f2858823c52bede86fe8d115ff5"}]},{"sourceName":"爱弹幕 (1080zyk)","sourceUrl":"http://www.lovedan.net/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"1080zyk","links":[{"name":"20260704期","url":"https://cdn.yzzy28-play.com/20260705/32176_11f23659/index.m3u8"},{"name":"20260705纯享版","url":"https://cdn.yzzy28-play.com/20260711/32382_1d304d9c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"20260711期","url":"https://cdn.yzzyvip-29.com/20260711/25647_92e2febe/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"动漫发布 (1080zyk)","sourceUrl":"http://ddmf.net/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"1080zyk","links":[{"name":"20260704期","url":"https://cdn.yzzy28-play.com/20260705/32176_11f23659/index.m3u8"},{"name":"20260705纯享版","url":"https://cdn.yzzy28-play.com/20260711/32382_1d304d9c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"20260711期","url":"https://cdn.yzzyvip-29.com/20260711/25647_92e2febe/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"百度资源 (dbm3u8)","sourceUrl":"http://api.apibdzy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"dbm3u8","links":[{"name":"20260704第1期","url":"https://b3.bdzybf22.com/videos/202607/10/6a508643bbd92ac0f5ffccb6/38bfg5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"20260705纯享版","url":"https://b3.bdzybf22.com/videos/202607/10/6a508638bbd92ac0f5ffcca9/33889g/index.m3u8"}]}]},{"id":"6712edd42225476cae335fd95db9d680","title":"了不起的少年","type":"zongyi","pic":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20260531-1/ed292fa979153ac4acbdb58d91a4e986.jpg","lang":"国语","area":"大陆","year":"2026","note":"更新至20260712期","actor":"李锐 冯青 方锦龙 林跃 姜潮","director":"","des":"<p>中国首档青少年创造力文化科普传承创新综艺《了不起的少年》，以“非遗不老，文明永续”为第一季核心主题，下设“了不起的非遗”“了不起的练习生”“了不起的挑战”三大特色板块。节目打破传统科普边界，将国家级非遗项目沉浸式融入青少年生活场景，用创新表达激活非遗生命力，让传统文化精神代代相传，更让每个少年的梦想在文化传承中绽放璀璨光芒。</p>","last":"2026-07-12 13:23:23","sources":[{"sourceName":"360资源 (360zy)","sourceUrl":"https://360zy.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"360zy","links":[{"name":"第20251115期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260531/8BbHTru7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260531期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260531/ineyCXTK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260607期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260607/sYmtxu6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260614期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260614/YQnzZBWa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260621期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260621/5rRJ4LxH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260628期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260628/tibF1Kqu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260705期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260705/IY5xCvyv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第20260712期","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20260712/1tFVELn6/index.m3u8"}]},{"sourceName":"量子资源 (liangzi)","sourceUrl":"https://cj.lziapi.com/api.php/provide/vod/","from":"liangzi","links":[{"name":"20260531","url":"https://v.lzcdn28.com/share/77b8